<title>USA: Catalyst Intl names McGowan president, COO.</title>
<headline>Catalyst Intl names McGowan president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalyst International Inc said it named Sean McGowan president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Vaemond Crane, who previously held the president's title, will remain chairman of the board of directors.  </p>
<p>Catalyst, a manufacturer of warehouse management software, also said it will redeem about 250,000 shares of its common stock held by Crane.</p>
<p>McGowan most recently served as the company's senior vice president of North American operations. He joined the company in May.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
